OL,3,GNEWSACars stranded as flash floods hit
OL,4,Aseaside town
OL,5,
OL,6,FMotorists faced flash floods in
OL,7,FScarborough on Friday evening, with
OL,8,Fvehicles stranded and roads closed.
OL,10,FEmergency services attended as several
OL,11,Fvehicles became stuck in flood water,
OL,12,Fand North Yorkshire Police warned
OL,13,Fmotorists and pedestrians to avoid the
OL,14,Ftown centre.
OL,16,FFlooded areas included Manor Road,
OL,17,FScalby Road, Valley Road, Valley
OL,18,FBridge, Filey Road, Ramshill Road, and
OL,19,Fthe surrounding streets.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
