OL,3,GNEWSACars stranded as flash floods hit
OL,4,Aseaside town
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice said the water receded into the
OL,7,Fevening, although some roads remained
OL,8,Fclosed, and advised people to avoid the
OL,9,Farea and follow closure signs.
